{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_mac_tu_21_1","chapterId":"ch_work_mac_tu_21","text":"流傳載錄","sortOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_mac_tu_21_2","chapterId":"ch_work_mac_tu_21","text":"〈漢書．藝文志〉：","sortOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_mac_tu_21_3","chapterId":"ch_work_mac_tu_21","text":"《尹佚》二篇。〔周臣，在成、康時也。〕","sortOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_mac_tu_21_4","chapterId":"ch_work_mac_tu_21","text":"《田俅子》三篇。〔先韓子。〕〔一〕","sortOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_mac_tu_21_5","chapterId":"ch_work_mac_tu_21","text":"《我子》一篇。〔二〕","sortOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_mac_tu_21_6","chapterId":"ch_work_mac_tu_21","text":"《隨巢子》六篇。〔墨翟弟子。〕","sortOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_mac_tu_21_7","chapterId":"ch_work_mac_tu_21","text":"《胡非子》三篇。〔墨翟弟子。〕","sortOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_mac_tu_21_8","chapterId":"ch_work_mac_tu_21","text":"《墨子》七十一篇。〔名翟，為宋大夫，在孔子後。〕","sortOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_mac_tu_21_9","chapterId":"ch_work_mac_tu_21","text":"右墨六家，八十六篇。","sortOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_mac_tu_21_10","chapterId":"ch_work_mac_tu_21","text":"〔一〕　蘇林曰：「俅音仇。」","sortOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_mac_tu_21_11","chapterId":"ch_work_mac_tu_21","text":"〔二〕　師古曰：「劉向別錄雲為墨子之學。」","sortOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_mac_tu_21_12","chapterId":"ch_work_mac_tu_21","text":"墨家者流，蓋出於清廟之守。茅屋采椽，〔一〕是以貴儉；養三老五更，是以兼愛；","sortOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_mac_tu_21_13","chapterId":"ch_work_mac_tu_21","text":"選士大射，是以上賢；宗祀嚴父，是以右鬼〔二〕；順四時而行，是以非命；〔三〕以孝","sortOrder":13},{"id":"s_work_mac_tu_21_14","chapterId":"ch_work_mac_tu_21","text":"視天下，是以上同：〔四〕此其所長也。及蔽者為之，見儉之利，因以非禮，推兼愛之意","sortOrder":14},{"id":"s_work_mac_tu_21_15","chapterId":"ch_work_mac_tu_21","text":"，而不知別親疏。","sortOrder":15},{"id":"s_work_mac_tu_21_16","chapterId":"ch_work_mac_tu_21","text":"〔一〕師古曰：「采，柞木也，字作棌，本從木。以茅覆屋，以棌為椽，言其質素也。采","sortOrder":16},{"id":"s_work_mac_tu_21_17","chapterId":"ch_work_mac_tu_21","text":"音千在反。」","sortOrder":17},{"id":"s_work_mac_tu_21_18","chapterId":"ch_work_mac_tu_21","text":"〔二〕如淳曰：「右鬼，謂信鬼神。若杜伯射宣王，是親鬼而右之。」師古曰：「右猶尊","sortOrder":18},{"id":"s_work_mac_tu_21_19","chapterId":"ch_work_mac_tu_21","text":"尚也。」","sortOrder":19},{"id":"s_work_mac_tu_21_20","chapterId":"ch_work_mac_tu_21","text":"〔三〕蘇林曰：「非有命者，言儒者執有命，而反勸人修德積善，政教與行相反，故譏之","sortOrder":20},{"id":"s_work_mac_tu_21_21","chapterId":"ch_work_mac_tu_21","text":"也。」如淳曰：「言無吉凶之命，但有賢不肖（之）善惡。」","sortOrder":21},{"id":"s_work_mac_tu_21_22","chapterId":"ch_work_mac_tu_21","text":"〔四〕如淳曰：「言皆同，可以治也。」師古曰：「墨子有〈節用〉、〈兼愛〉、〈上賢","sortOrder":22},{"id":"s_work_mac_tu_21_23","chapterId":"ch_work_mac_tu_21","text":"〉、〈明鬼神〉、〈非命〉、〈上同〉等諸篇，故志歷序其本意也。視讀曰示。」","sortOrder":23}],"overrides":{}}